@end group
@group
  (setq x-pointer-shape (string-to-number mpointer))
  (set-mouse-color "white"))
@end group
@end smallexample

@item
或者您可以在列表中设置各种特征的值，如下所示：

@smallexample
@group
(setq-default
 default-frame-alist
 '((cursor-color . "white")
   (mouse-color . "white")
   (foreground-color . "white")
   (background-color . "DodgerBlue4")
